    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Geraghty offer 20 The Crescent to the market, a beautifully presented, 5 bedroom detached residence with detached garage, having a large side entrance that can accommodate the parking of vehicles behind the metal framed side gate, an attic conversion to fabulous storage rooms and enviously located opposite a large green.No 20 benefits from many features and extras, some of which include well portioned rooms that suit the flexible needs of a growing family, a stunning attic conversion with a shower room installed and 4 large windows capturing light and sun, beautifully tiled bathrooms, lovely flooring, wainscotting in guest WC downstairs, bespoke fitted storage cupboards and shelving in sitting room, upgraded hot water tank, upgraded gas boiler, glass panel doors, a conversion of the 5th bedroom into a dressing room, a detached garage with remote roller shutter door, extensive cobble lock driveway, parking area that extends along the side of there residence to the garage area where vehicles can be parked inside the steel frame gate to mention but a few. This lovely family home is well positioned in the development, opposite a large green, and is not overlooked to the rear.Gardens are walled and the exterior is low maintenance. With schools a short walk or drive away and its proximity to the bus stop which is at the entrance to the development, No 20 will capture the eye of those seeking a home, with little or nothing to do, that allows hybrid working with easy access to all major road networks.For transparency purposes, all bidding will be carried out on line via our unique bidding platform: \"MySherryFitz\""
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nComposite front door with double glazed side panel, tiled floor, radiator cover, coving and key pad alarm\n\nGuest WC and WHB - \nTiled floor, floating sink wainscotting to walls\n\nSitting Room - \nFireplace with Stanley stove insert, half hexagonal window, antique engineered oak style flooring, bespoke fitted units and shelving, double doors to dining room, coving and centre rose\n\nReception Room - \nHalf hexagonal window and side window, engineered antique Oak style flooring, coving and centre rose\n\nKitchen/Dining - \nArray of storage cupboards at base and eye level, Belfast sink, Quooker tap, granite worktops, integrated dishwasher, double ovens, extractor hood, tiled over worktop, tiled flooring, recessed lights, French doors to garden from dining area\n\nUtility Room - \nFitted cupboards and storage solutions for coats, jackets and shoes, plumbed for utilities, tiled floor, side entrance and Glow Worm Gas boiler (replaced 2017)\n\nGuest WC and WHB - \nLovely wainscotting to walls and tiled floor\n\nUpstairs - \nCarpet stairs to very spacious landing area with stairs to attic space, coving and recessed lightingAiring Cupboard, pump for showers, large steel hot water tank, immersion installed and shelving\n\nBathroom - \nFully tiled, shower screen to bath, towel radiator, recessed lighting, extractor fan and window for natural light and ventilation\n\nMain Bedroom - \nFeature arch window, built in wardrobes (replaced 4 years ago) with drawer section, recessed lighting\n\nEn Suite Shower Room - \nFully tiled, floating vanity basin and vanity cabinet, recessed lighting, window for natural light and ventilation\n\nBedroom 2 - \nThis double bedroom at the front of the residence has feature wall panelling\n\nBedroom 3 - \nA double bedroom with built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 4 - \nDouble bedroom with built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom 5 / Dressing Room - \nAn excellent addition to the bedroom accommodation\n\nAttic Conversion - \nCarpet stairs and landing to the attic rooms providing excellent storage Room - very large, access to storage in eaves, 4 x \"Fakro\" windows that hinge for easy cleaningEn-Suite Shower room with \"Fakro\" window, floating sink, towel radiator, fully tiled, recessed lightsRoom 2 - \"Fakro\" window, recessed lighting\n\nGarage - \nLarge garage with motorised door and side access, electrics laid on, storage units fitted for optimum use\n\nExterior - \nWalled front gardenCobble lock driveway and parking area that extends along the side of the house to the garage areaMetal frame gate and pedestrian gate to side allowing vehicles to be parked in front of garagePaved patioWalled rear gardensOutdoor socket and timer\n\nIncluded in sale - \nCarpets, blinds, light fixtures & fittings, oven, hob, extractor fan, dishwasher\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>B Rated?</li><li>Positioned opposite a large green</li><li>Cobble lock driveway with secure parking to rear and access to garage from wide side entrance.</li><li>Metal frame side gate closing off the side entrance</li><li>Not overlooked front or rear</li><li>On-site Creche </li><li>Walking distance village centre</li><li>Double glazed units replaced 2021</li><li>Bus stop at entrance to development</li><li>Outdoor socket with timer</li><li>No management fees - residents association; voluntary contribution of 100.00pa</li><li>Mains services, GFCH - Glow Worm Gas boiler (replaced 2017)</ul>"
